Package: turbochook
Title: A Simple LLM Agent Written in R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("CJ", "Brown", email = "christo.j.brown@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A small, transparent LLM coding agent. The agent thinks, calls
    tools, observes the results and repeats until it calls task_complete.
    Built on 'ellmer'. R code runs in a separate 'callr' session.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    callr,
    cli,
    ellmer (>= 0.4.0),
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
